    "Created via Kibana Dashboards API (kibana-dashboards skill).",
    "All field paths validated via ES|QL before building.",
    "Panels use dataView ID 18dd83e8-6f88-474f-b434-a4b6c14a04a2 (metrics-gamepulse.* wildcard).",
    "Frame fields confirmed: avg_1s, low_1pct, low_01pct, frametime_ms, stutter_count all live.",
    "Session fields confirmed: gamepulse.game.name.keyword, gamepulse.game.steam_app_id, host.os.name.keyword.",
    "GPU fields confirmed: utilisation_pct, power_w available in gpu stream.",
    "8 panels: 2 filter controls, avg FPS bar, 1% low FPS bar, FPS timeline by game, GPU util by game, GPU power by game, performance summary table.",
    "Default time range set to now-30d to capture multiple sessions.",
    "stutter_count uses MAX (TSDS counter field — never avg/sum).",
    "B2.8 (2026-04-25): added ctrl-source and ctrl-launcher filter controls; added launcher-breakdown bar panel.",
    "gamepulse.game.source and gamepulse.game.launcher are native keyword fields (no .keyword sub-field needed).",
    "launcher-breakdown panel pins data_stream.dataset=gamepulse.session — source/launcher only live in session stream."
